  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The given differential equation can be written as<br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>.</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi></math><br />Integrating factor <math><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></math><br />Hence, solution of given differential equation,<br /><math><mi>y</mi><mo>.</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>.</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>.</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>.</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>.</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>.</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;(using integration by parts)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>.</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>.</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p>Given,&nbsp;<math><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Solution of given differential is</p><p><math><mi>y</mi><mo>.</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>.</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mfrac></math></p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>"
